        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Update exception information for Navigation.navigate()]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41915</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41915"/>
        <updated>2025-11-12T14:03:32.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/>

<h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">The <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Navigation/navigate" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">Navigation.navigate()</code></a> method now disallows <code class="notranslate">javascript:</code> URLs for security purposes. See <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3292278858" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/11533" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/whatwg/html/pull/11533/hovercard" href="https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/11533">whatwg/html#11533</a>.</p>
<p dir="auto">This PR:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Corrects the related info on the ref page (it was already there but inaccurate).</li>
<li>Adds another missing exception to the page and makes some additions and minor cleanup.</li>
<li>Adds a rel note mentioning it to the Fx144 rel notes (which is when Firefox implemented this; see <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1981104" rel="nofollow">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1981104</a>)</li>
