<h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">Chrome 143 adds support for the WebGPU <a href="https://gpuweb.github.io/gpuweb/#dom-gpufeaturename-texture-component-swizzle" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">texture-component-swizzle</code></a> feature, which, when enabled, allows usage of the <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/GPUTexture/createView" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">createView()</code></a> method's <a href="https://gpuweb.github.io/gpuweb/#dom-gputextureviewdescriptor-swizzle" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">swizzle</code></a> option that allows developers to perform color swizzles.</p>
<p dir="auto">See <a href="https://chromestatus.com/feature/5110223547269120" rel="nofollow">https://chromestatus.com/feature/5110223547269120</a>.</p>
<p dir="auto">This PR adds documentation for both the feature and the option.</p>

